2026-09-04T02:09:41.0914863Z +     "\n",
2026-09-04T02:09:41.0915123Z +     "Skipping the duckdb test suite.\n",
2026-09-04T02:09:41.0915408Z +     "\n",
2026-09-04T02:09:41.0915993Z +     "The duckdb tests exercise DuckDB's bundled C++ engine and are deliberately\n",
